Error [E1110]: `group` is a `TaskGroup` and cannot escape in a lambda
  --> tests/ui/taskgroup_parameter_escape.jet:4:12
    |
  4 |     return () => use_group(group)
    |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a task group is a scoped spawn authority that may flow only through direct named-function calls
 Fix: move this work to `fn helper(group: TaskGroup)` and call the helper directly
